BDX 0 xs I = min((V(xt) - V(xs))/3m, pow(10, pwl(V(xs), 1.8000,1.0969, 3.3000,0.6675, 3.5000,0.5563, 3.6800,0.5185, 3.8400,0.4955, 3.9900,0.4624, 4.1300,0.4409, 4.3300,0.4065, 4.5700,0.3909, 4.7900,0.3820, 4.9500,0.3820, 5.2500,-0.3979, 9.0000,-0.3979)))
CXS xs 0 1 IC=8.6021
RXS xs 0 1e12
